   "text": "University of Liverpool (Online) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Liverpool (Online)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nOur innovative online degrees provide flexible study options for individuals with busy lives. You can study from a library, café or even the comfort of your own sofa with your laptop, tablet, or mobile phone. Your study materials will be available 24 hours a day and seven days a week – so there is no need to worry about missing a class when a meeting overruns or you need to pick up the children from school.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 05:19\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 05:19\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £21,000.00\nMin: £2,550.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n60%\n6,000 of 10,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nKaplan Open Learning\nFounded Year\n2020\nCampus(es)\nLiverpool\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Sudan, Cameroon\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n31/08/2025\nContract End Date\n31/07/2026\nOverride Till Contract End Date\nN/A\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpired\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nThe current date has crossed the agreement validity date.\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://online.liverpool.ac.uk/fees-and-funding/goods-and-services-tax/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://online.liverpool.ac.uk/fees-and-funding/discounts-and-scholarships/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qI_bYGYg6Ds\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
